71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ob7YTYr7KOoQ7kNvwGzADDc&_nc_oc=AdpS9Uxjc4vHnZSFbBCiN4K5X2ikp_xQ6INAvXPD7U53E9q1g2naQ8JF4nmkWX6H8Nw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_F54AfbNti3lNtCGGI3TjdA1wE8p_5WD5f_Gb2plhbag&oe=6A2810B9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F8UdcHxeZzEQ7kNvwFuO9YX&_nc_oc=AdoBC71PcDBy1lWGZj70N37zCkUbSfWyLMoQ4k_rLqgisskFVu4i3yRm7EksydHbzFU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-ht8Z5vLTfwuj6WzAK89W7EK9hR5XpZaXJNOR6G6X-8Q&oe=6A282393"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-_2KvuDPwi0Q7kNvwF7ins-&_nc_oc=AdpfrRZohKM4tpJ39eRCXj64TSPmL33szt75J7r3ko4AZJbUXZGnwxpKImo_G-E3Fo8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9DFBHkLGsqZ79ek5USa4aNmQDSwRgQ3OD1-eET5yTaTw&oe=6A2821DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: